 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Fa Jin — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You can store and release kinetic energy using your cursed technique.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, you can store and release energy. When you miss with a melee attack, you gain a Jin charge. You can have a number of Jin charges equal to your proficiency bonus + your level.<br />\nYou can spend a Jin charge or 1 Cursed Energy to either gain a +2 to a melee or cursed energy attack roll or deal an additional damage die for each charge spent. <br />\nYou must declare how many Jin charges you are using before making an attack or using a technique and can use a number of Jin charges equal to your proficiency bonus at once. On a miss, you waste the Jin charges. You lose all unused Jin charges on a long rest.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
